GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:16.380
Mountains are calling

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.340
The sky is calling

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:27.850
Something awaits you in the distance

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:34.230
So brightly     the blood burns

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:42.360
You understand why you were born

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.700
Run and Run!

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:46.660
Run and Run!

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:50.240
Become the wind, and run

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:56.960
Go on, you're going to surpass the yesterdays you

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:04.760
You will stand up to yourself     to greater things

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:07.970
That's right!     It is young

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:14.980
It doesn't burn out     A shooting star

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:32.340
<i>For Akakabutos four forts, The Leader
had divided all males into 4 units.</i>

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:49.660
<i> Silver's group defeated Madara
and continues further. </i>

00:01:55.050 --> 00:02:00.960
<i>But they were ambushed by Mosa,
and Silver was in danger.</i>

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:25.450
<i> To defeat Mosa, Benizakura pulled
him down in a lake. </i>

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.410
<i> But his backpaw got stuck under the rope.</i>

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.260
<i>And so ended his eventful life. </i>

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:50.350
NOW IS THE TIME TO SHOW THE COURAGE OF A MALE<i>!!</i>
SILVER IN RAGE<i>!</i>

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:57.600
<i>This year's storm, brought
an unusual cold wave to Japan.</i>

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:02.810
<i>Even though it was still autumn,
the first snow began to fall in Twin Pass.</i>

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.580
It snows...

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.250
It's unusual with
early snow in Ouu.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:14.410
Ben...

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:23.200
Fantastic! Heaven is on our side!

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:28.460
Bears go into hibernation in the winter.
This confuses them.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.220
Then it's time to attack!

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:30.970
Yes.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:34.470
Everyone! We can't beat Akakabuto
if we miss this opportunity!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:37.970
Let's go!

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:41.720
<i>The death of Benizakura,
inspired the young ones.</i>

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:44.320
<i>There are 800 males
left to fight Akakabuto.</i>

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:49.820
<i>They are heading for the top of
Twin Pass, and the last showdown.</i>

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.160
<i>They are healed.
Ben's vision is completely back!</i>

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.500
<i>Eyes, please endure!</i>

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:58.660
<i>At least until
I've fought Akakabuto!</i>

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:10.510
What is it that roaring?

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.390
Ben, over here!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:21.270
Internal battle?

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:24.020
They've gone mad in the cold?

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.120
That's Kesagake...

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:40.120
Kesagake?

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.120
He's one rank higher
than Mosa and Madara.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.930
He was the Akakabuto's
2:nd in command.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:48.340
So much was Kesagake worth, with
getting killed in one shot.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.890
Maybe he is...
an intruder?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:59.890
He may want to show his power to
Akakabuto's family, to become a soldier!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.390
Not good!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.400
He's a monster.

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:11.900
Look at his back!

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:16.660
He's coming!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.580
Now he's targeting us!

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:21.920
Silver!

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.560
We'll kill him ourselves!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.290
Yes!

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:26.580
Advance teams! Attack!

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:45.650
What happened, John?

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.860
I can't bite through.
His coat is like steel.

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:49.900
Our turn!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.910
A really hard head!

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:00.910
This time, it's the rest of the squad.
Come on!

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:14.130
Stay back!
Don't waste your lives!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:22.880
<i>Despite the words of Ben, old and
young attacked with all force.</i>

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:25.850
<i>But it had no effect
on the brown bear.</i>

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:27.610
Watch out!

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:27.780
Run away!
Watch out!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:28.410
Run away!

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.280
These stupid bastards!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:37.910
Stop there!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.620
Silver, stop!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.540
Strange... He must be crazy.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:47.750
It's probably the old wounds on his back.
The cold is biting into them.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.490
Old wounds?

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:56.790
The story of a ferocious brown bear, who got
three harpoons driven into the back by humans...

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.300
<i>Wilson continues to tell the story:</i>

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:04.300
<i>Last summer, One wrecked ship was
stranded in the beaches of Aomori.</i>

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:08.770
<i>3 months ago, a ship disappeared
off Nemuro, called "Kairyumaru".</i>

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:15.480
<i>Inspectors from the coast guard, went straight
into the ship for an investigation...</i>

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:31.960
<i>The brown bear came across this
ship on its way across the sea.</i>

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:38.340
<i>It killed 25 crew members, one after another
and devoured them. He was round and fat.</i>

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:44.480
<i> The three harpoons in the back
were marks after the battle. </i>

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:49.610
If such a dangerous bear gets into
Akakabuto's subordinate, it will be tough.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.560
Anyway... We can't let that happen.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:54.340
Ben, I'll take him!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:55.990
Silver!

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.610
It's dangerous
to chase him alone!

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.080
Watch out, Silver!

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:13.500
Silver!

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.090
<i>He stopped... Why?</i>

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.350
<i>He could have killed me,
but why didn't he!</i>

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:38.860
<i>He's not crazy!
It's a trap! </i>

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.060
Ben...

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.950
Will he lead us to
Akakabuto's castle?

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:46.950
I don't think we're going
all the way to the castle...

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.040
Silver, maybe he's using us
to to draw out The Leader!

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:57.750
Yeah.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:02.790
Even if it's a trap, it's a great opportunity
to break into the castle of Akakabuto at once.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:07.390
Don't rush!

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:09.850
Keep the distance and follow him!

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.400
Oh! That is...!

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:19.150
It's the castle!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.850
It must be Akakabuto's castle!

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:22.490
<i>At last...</i>

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:26.910
Halt!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.800
So this is Akakabuto's castle?

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:43.420
Akakabuto, are you here?

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:50.430
That's him!

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:05.990
Akakabuto!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.200
His size...

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:20.990
He's more than twice as big,
since we last saw him.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.350
What's he doing?

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:35.480
So he want to become his
subordinate after all.

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:36.930
No, they're not friends!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:37.700
That's it!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:39.980
That bear might have come
to challenge Akakabuto!

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:40.980
Can't be...

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:42.980
What are you mumbling about?

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.190
Make a battle formation, right away!

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:10.770
It seem to me we were led here.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.860
I think Befriending him
was his intention all along.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:42.130
That terrible monster...
He killed him with one blow!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.630
That's crazy strong!

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:48.130
<i>Akakabuto did not allow any outlaws.</i>

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:54.550
<i>His roar felt like the
sky and earth shook.</i>

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.580
What a giant!

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:22.330
Who's pissing?

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:26.460
Where's The Leader at a time like this?

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.550
Without him, we can't fight!

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:32.770
We can do it!
Don't start hesitating!

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:34.600
He's an excellent enemy!

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:35.810
That's right!

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.350
Ben, do you know where The Leader is?

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:42.600
From the back side...
He went to the peak of Akakabuto's castle.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.630
Alone?

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:44.740
Yes.
Alone?

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:45.350
Yes.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:50.810
He should've showed up by now...
He's late. Too late.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:01.880
<i>The Leader was alive.</i>

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:07.150
<i>Seeing hell twice, he came back from
the bottom of the earth again.</i>

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:48.470
<i>Silver!</i>

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:58.970
<i>The Leader, who was buried alive by Akakabutos
subordinates, was hit all over his body.</i>

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:01.480
<i>The violent impacts brought
an unexpected effect.</i>

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:05.520
<i> All the memories he
lost, came back. </i>

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.770
<i>The falling snow,
took part in the awakening.</i>

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:13.770
<i>Riki!</i>

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.040
<i>Riki, hurry up and run away!</i>

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:21.830
<i>Riki!</i>

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:23.580
<i>Rik...</i>

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:54.030
That little one...

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:57.030
<i>Father! You're my father!</i>

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:58.530
<i>I see...</i>

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:00.260
<i>So that's how it is?</i>

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:02.280
<i>Silver is my child?</i>

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:07.290
<i> The Leader, had hated
Akakabuto without knowing why. </i>

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.470
<i>He clearly understood why now.</i>

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:12.500
<i>That is why...
The Leader defied death.</i>

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:13.450
<i>I mean...</i>

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.630
<i>bear dog Riki.</i>

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.730
<i>He was filled with an unprecedented
rage towards Akakabuto. </i>

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.130
<i>Wait, Silver!</i>

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:21.830
<i>I'm coming!</i>

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.530
That is...

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:31.230
The Leader! The Leader's howling!

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:42.740
Silver...

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.520
<i>Silver's howling...</i>

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.990
<i>It was a mighty one just
like his father, Riki.</i>

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:56.500
<i>The young males who were frozen in fear,
felt it disappear in an instant.</i>

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:00.430
<i>Father, I have to do it!</i>

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.430
<i>Daisuke, Grandpa, look at me.</i>

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.680
<i> I will finish this grudge now!</i>

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:10.860
Alright!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.690
We're starting an all-out attack!

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:13.940
<b>(All) Ooook!</b>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.450
Charge!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:24.950
Don't fall behind Silver now!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.880
We're gonna be the first
ones to sink our teeth into em'!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.790
The Three Brothers of Kai is here!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:37.000
Benizakura! Your soul is with me!
We'll take Akakabuto together!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:56.860
Die!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:17.960
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.710
<i>That's why he didn't want
the bear with the 3 harpoons? </i>

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:24.470
<i>So is this enough bears for him?</i>

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.000
Akakabuto!

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.730
I will never give you Ouu!

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:01.720
Watch out!

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.100
Leader...
Glad you're okay.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.350
We've been waiting for you.

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:11.600
Sorry for the delay.

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:24.390
<i>Something is different...
There is something new in his eyes...</i>

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.620
Listen up everybody!

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:32.120
Only three bears of Akakabuto's
forces is remaining!

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:33.870
Now we have the chance!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.620
Crush them!

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:45.310
Charge!

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:57.400
<i> With The Leader at their side again, it felt
like they had received one million males. </i>

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:05.700
<i>Akakabuto also ordered,
the last battle for his subordinates.</i>

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:10.950
Don't hesitate!

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:14.370
With 800 fangs, any
enemy will turn into bones!

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:23.090
<i>Please endure, eyes!</i>

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:32.430
Ben!

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:39.660
Cross...

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:43.350
I can't lay down my life like this!
For you and our children!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:55.120
Move!
I'll pull him down!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:00.090
Ben!

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:08.090
Ben, let go!
We'll take him down!

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:34.860
You're a brown bear?
Then you know who I am!

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:39.870
I'm the "Brown Bear Killer" Hakuro!

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:42.150
Don't lose to Hakuro!

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:51.340
You're lucky to die
by Hakuro's fangs!

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:05.360
<i>Akakabuto's subordinates,
had a terrifying endurance.</i>

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:11.310
<i>Although the dogs were so many,
it was an equal battle.</i>

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:16.450
<i> But the bears were getting tired. </i>

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:24.080
<i>Akakabuto was stressed
and was eager to attack.</i>

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:25.960
<i>But he could not move.</i>

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:30.460
<i>Because The Leader's sharp eyes,
blocked Akakabuto's movement.</i>

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:36.470
Hakuro killed him!

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:37.720
Don't be stupid.

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:40.220
It was the Kai brothers,
who killed him!

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:53.110
Ben, let go!
We'll take care of it...

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:56.360
What are you talking about?
This bastard can't kill me!

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:14.470
Ben, are you okay?

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:19.720
I won't die until I've put
my teeth in Akakabuto!

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:22.220
Only Akakabuto left.

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:28.120
<i>After a fierce battle, the dogs had
defeated Akakabuto's bears.</i>

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:30.440
<i>Akakabuto, was the only one remaining.</i>

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:35.940
<i>But before the roaring
and furious bear...</i>

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:39.200
<i>The most daring males, hesitated.</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:41.700
<i>That huge demon!</i>

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:44.200
<i> Can they defeat Akakabuto? </i>

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:47.710
<i>But he must be
defeated at all costs!</i>

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.460
<i>The last battle for Ouu,
was about to start.</i>

00:22:55.430 --> 00:23:00.310
To be continued...

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:19.780
When a shower of a moonlight

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:25.910
bathes you gently

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:32.050
Say goodbye to pain and

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:40.610
let it flow away

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:46.610
For he who lives today with all his heart

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:53.240
a better tomorrow will surely come

00:23:53.580 --> 00:23:59.420
TOMORROW, let us run again

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:05.300
TOMORROW, lets shine brightly
